{
    "title": "Smart Code Engine",
    "description": "Smart Code Engine app is a showcase for secure on-premise SDK for scanning debit and credit cards, 1D and 2D barcodes, MRZ with unprecedented speed and precision. The app shows how to streamline payments, money transfers and improve user experience in customer onboarding. The SDK extracts data from machine-readable zones (MRZ) for passports, ID cards, visas, and others.\r\n\r\nSmart Code Engines has three demonstration AI-powered scanners inside:\r\n\r\n1. Debit and credit cards scanner:\r\nSupports on-premise scanning credit cards issued according to the standards of VISA, MasterCard, Maestro, American Express, JCB, UnionPay, Diners Club, Discover, RuPay, Elo, Verve, VPay, Girocard, PagoBancomat, MyDebit, Troy, BC Card, Interac, Carte Bancaire, Dankort, MIR, and provides an automatic credit card scanning for cards of any type: embossed, indent, and flat printed, with horizontal or portrait layout, with digits printed on the front or backside. \r\n\r\n2. MRZ scanner:\r\nProvides on-premise scans and extracts data automatically from machine-readable zones (MRZ) compliant with international standards ISO / ICAO (IEC 7501-1/ICAO Document 9303 ISO) and local (Russia, France, Switzerland, Bulgaria, Ecuador, Kenya) standards for passports, residence permits, ID cards, visas, and others.\r\n\r\n3. Barcode scanner:\r\nProvides on-premise data reading from 1D barcodes (CODABAR, CODE_39, CODE_93, CODE_128, EAN_8, EAN_13, ITF, ITF14, UPC_A, UPC_E) and 2D barcodes (QR code, rMQR, AZTEC, PDF417 and DataMatrix) suitable for a wide range of bills, receipts, taxes, and AAMVA-compliant IDs.\r\n\r\n4. Phone lines:\r\nProvides on-premise scan of a handwritten or printed mobile phone number.\r\n\r\n5. Payment details scanner:\r\nProvides on-premise scans of various payment details of Russia (INN, KPP, Bank's BIC, etc.), as well as payment details for international transfers (IBAN).\r\n\r\nSECURITY:\r\nSmart Code Engine app does NOT transfer, save or store the extracted data \u2014 the recognition process is performed in the local RAM of the device. The app does NOT require internet access.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about Smart Code Engine SDK for your mobile, desktop, or web applications, please contact our sales team: sales@smartengines.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Smart Code Engine app is a showcase for secure on-premise SDK for scanning debit and credit cards, 1D and 2D barcodes, MRZ with unprecedented speed and precision. The app shows how to streamline payments, money transfers and improve user experience in customer onboarding. The SDK extracts data from machine-readable zones (MRZ) for passports, ID cards, visas, and others.<br><br>Smart Code Engines has three demonstration AI-powered scanners inside:<br><br>1. Debit and credit cards scanner:<br>Supports on-premise scanning credit cards issued according to the standards of VISA, MasterCard, Maestro, American Express, JCB, UnionPay, Diners Club, Discover, RuPay, Elo, Verve, VPay, Girocard, PagoBancomat, MyDebit, Troy, BC Card, Interac, Carte Bancaire, Dankort, MIR, and provides an automatic credit card scanning for cards of any type: embossed, indent, and flat printed, with horizontal or portrait layout, with digits printed on the front or backside. <br><br>2. MRZ scanner:<br>Provides on-premise scans and extracts data automatically from machine-readable zones (MRZ) compliant with international standards ISO / ICAO (IEC 7501-1/ICAO Document 9303 ISO) and local (Russia, France, Switzerland, Bulgaria, Ecuador, Kenya) standards for passports, residence permits, ID cards, visas, and others.<br><br>3. Barcode scanner:<br>Provides on-premise data reading from 1D barcodes (CODABAR, CODE_39, CODE_93, CODE_128, EAN_8, EAN_13, ITF, ITF14, UPC_A, UPC_E) and 2D barcodes (QR code, rMQR, AZTEC, PDF417 and DataMatrix) suitable for a wide range of bills, receipts, taxes, and AAMVA-compliant IDs.<br><br>4. Phone lines:<br>Provides on-premise scan of a handwritten or printed mobile phone number.<br><br>5. Payment details scanner:<br>Provides on-premise scans of various payment details of Russia (INN, KPP, Bank&#39;s BIC, etc.), as well as payment details for international transfers (IBAN).<br><br>SECURITY:<br>Smart Code Engine app does NOT transfer, save or store the extracted data \u2014 the recognition process is performed in the local RAM of the device. The app does NOT require internet access.<br><br>To learn more about Smart Code Engine SDK for your mobile, desktop, or web applications, please contact our sales team: sales@smartengines.com.",
